# Nothing of a working folder's keys, state or secrets may ever reach an image: what .gitignore keeps
# out of a commit, at any depth (here that takes **/).
**/keys
**/data
**/store.key
**/*.key
**/api-key*
**/*-pha.json
**/*-base.json
**/market.mainnet.json
**/.env*

# Made again in the image, or not needed in it.
**/node_modules
.node
.node-download
.git
test
brand
